Hong Kong authorities have warned residents travelling to France to be aware of risks and take safety precautions, as violent protests spread across the European nation.



A man walks past a row of burnt out vehicles on Rue Yves Toudic destroyed after a nationwide protest against the &#8220;high cost of living&#8221;, in central Paris on October 19, 2026. Photo: Kiran Ridley/AFP.



